_{2}\oplus\mathcal{F}_{3}\oplus\mathcal{F}_{4}\oplus\mathcal{F}_{5}%
\oplus\mathcal{F}_{6}\right\}  =\binom{2r}{0}+\binom{2r}{1}+\binom{2r}%
{2}+\binom{2r}{3}\\
&  =\binom{6}{0}+\binom{6}{1}+\binom{6}{2}+\binom{6}{3}+\binom{6}{4}+\binom
