$\rfloor$

In general
\begin{align}
\mathcal{F}  &  \mathcal{=}%
%TCIMACRO{\dbigoplus \limits_{0\leq j\leq2r}}%
%BeginExpansion
{\displaystyle\bigoplus\limits_{0\leq j\leq2r}}
